MODIFICATIONS
==============================================================================

Inherited from TradingAgents-Astock (v0.2.13):
  - A-stock (China mainland) data layer using mootdx, Tencent Finance,
    Eastmoney and other direct HTTP sources (akshare was removed in v0.2.5)
  - Three A-stock specific analyst agents (Policy, Hot Money, Lockup)
  - A-stock trading constraints (T+1, price limits, lot sizes) in Trader and PM
  - Chinese language output support
  - CSI 300 benchmark for alpha calculation (replacing SPY)
  - Various prompt and pipeline adaptations for A-share market specifics

Added by MARVEL on top of TradingAgents-Astock v0.2.13:
  - Rebranding and repackaging as MARVEL
  - Language-instruction injection for the three risk-management debators
  - More robust rating parsing (Chinese "评级：" labels, standalone-word fallback)
  - Fallback ticker resolution when persisting results
  - Web UI: auto-detection of the configured LLM provider, removal of the
    manual trade-date input, new MARVEL theme
  - One-click launchers (start.bat / start.sh / run.py / run_single.py)
    including batch analysis over a stock list

See CHANGES_FROM_UPSTREAM.md for the upstream modification list.
